      "sourceEvidence": "Classic-only. One initial Core task at +32 queues one initial attack and a first swipe task at +64. Each swipe records the exact native expired/replaced/emit branch, queues a fresh AttackEvent copy when active, and recursively schedules the next native 135/60 delay. End requires the actual zero-child terminal task; no fixed swipe count is asserted.",
