      "nonDamageCallbacksAndInitAudit": "Init A4 modifier, C2 detection radius/level and C4 buff data introduce no extra attack queues. Tick callbacks create particles and C4 party modifier only; C6 alters DEF ignore. Q kitsuneBurst queues its own attacks and marks all existing pointers deleted; fourth E and expiry pop oldest. A1 only resets cooldown from Q. No E damage arises outside the spawn/tick ancestry in classic.",
